{#
  Russian labels and placeholders for the eurobot course's node-creation/edit
  form (frame_requirement_form.jinja, via row_with_text_field.jinja and
  row_uid_with_reset/frame.jinja). The course's students are not assumed to
  read English (see AGENTS.md's "Technical writing" section), and the plain
  field names/"Enter ... here..." placeholders were confusing: a blank
  optional "MID" field looked like something the student had to fill in, and
  neither TITLE nor STATEMENT hinted at what INTERFACE_PARAMETER expects
  there (a technical variable name, and a "Тип: <тип>" line — as opposed to
  REQUIREMENT, where the same two fields hold a free-form title and the
  ЕСЛИ/КОГДА/IF pseudo-code statement).

  Falls back to the original field_name for any field this table doesn't
  recognize, so grammars/tags outside REQUIREMENT and INTERFACE_PARAMETER
  (SECTION, TEXT, TEST_CASE, ...) render exactly as before.

  element_type is an explicit macro parameter, not read from the calling
  template's context: row_uid_with_reset/stream.jinja (the /reset_uid
  response) renders row_uid_with_reset/frame.jinja without ever setting an
  element_type variable, and a Jinja macro only sees its own parameters plus
  the defining module's globals, never the caller's local `{% set %}`
  variables. Every call site below must pass its own element_type (or
  literal none, where the field is never element_type-dependent).
#}

{% macro field_label_ru(field_name) -%}
{%- if field_name == "MID" -%}MID (техническая метка)
{%- elif field_name == "UID" -%}Номер (UID)
{%- elif field_name == "TITLE" -%}Название (TITLE)
{%- elif field_name == "STATEMENT" -%}Текст (STATEMENT)
{%- else -%}{{ field_name }}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro field_placeholder_ru(field_name, element_type=none) -%}
{%- if field_name == "MID" -%}
необязательно: служебная метка узла, нужна StrictDoc для отслеживания правок — можно оставить пустым, она подставится сама
{%- elif field_name == "UID" -%}
номер уже предложен ниже — можно оставить как есть или вписать свой
{%- elif field_name == "TITLE" and element_type == "INTERFACE_PARAMETER" -%}
техническое имя переменной, ровно как оно пишется в условии/действии требования, например: input.started_cord
{%- elif field_name == "TITLE" -%}
краткое название требования, например: Периметр в начале матча
{%- elif field_name == "STATEMENT" and element_type == "INTERFACE_PARAMETER" -%}
укажите тип значения строкой «Тип: <тип>», например: Тип: bool
{%- elif field_name == "STATEMENT" -%}
например: ЕСЛИ (motor_Speed > 10) ТО робот должен уменьшить motor_Speed на 5
{%- else -%}
Введите значение поля «{{ field_name }}»
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}
